    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Morph is an API only, text in and text out family with two versions, both released on 2025-07-07. Neither version supports reasoning and neither publishes open weights, so the family is closed and aimed at plain text generation rather than step by step problem solving. The two tiers differ mainly in context and price. Morph V3 Large offers a 262144 token context window and up to 131072 output tokens at $0.9 per million input and $1.9 per million output. Morph V3 Fast offers 81920 tokens of context and 38000 output tokens at $0.8 per million input and $1.2 per million output. The facts suggest the family suits long text tasks such as summarising or drafting large documents, where the large tier's context is the draw. Limits are the lack of reasoning, no open weights, and output pricing that adds up on high volume work.",
